    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f348f2634f87f8f92834a4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我甚至不明白怎样跳好舞。\n跟着第一次听的曲子，我笨拙地挪动身体。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7bf3ae4763ebbf592b18a1336a57883fe7de0cc4dbd23284abc49a986b3211a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88f8325773f4567e41cb26fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中神宫一边嫌弃地说着\n『跳得真烂』，一边陪我\n跳完了整首曲子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "975599ad1c0c7ef881ed3ee81cdfb3c0c9eb49eb42e3953940aaa6d55f70d91a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
