      "uid": "zhcn:8be04c91605a2fb94be7b727",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "DJ的样子好酷，音乐也好棒！\n不过这么难得的机会，享受一下\n跳舞不也挺好的嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c016d272ec942173e1eb98220f3656c6cfaf3dfca3669485f66289d6c6f7805e",
